Revision history for Unblock-HTTP1

0.001  Development
    - Initial portable HTTP/1.0 and HTTP/1.1 protocol engine.
    - Event-loop, transport, and operating-system neutral byte interface.
    - Uniform::HTTP 0.04 request and response objects.
    - Strict request and response parsing with picohttpparser.
    - Fixed-length, chunked, and close-delimited body framing.
    - Lossless HTTP/1 trailer delivery into Uniform::HTTP messages.
    - Streaming request and response bodies with cooperative backpressure.
    - Informational responses and exact 101/CONNECT protocol handoff boundary.
